  "details": "Description\n\nHello im an ios user and ever since last week whenever i join certain ios capable worlds, the world download would crash and take me back to my homeworld. Ive tried cleaning my cache, updating the ios app, deleting snd redownloading the ios app and updating my ios software but nothing has worked and i do not know what to do\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nNo one is making this bug happen and theres no workarounds. I do not know what this really means anyways and it has nothing currently to do with my issue that i have been having trying to go to certain worlds \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: iOSMobile (platform: iOS - Mobile, store: TestFlight, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: IPhonePlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.20202\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
